## What Requires Human Review

Pause and ask before proceeding if you encounter:

- Changes to authentication, authorization, or secrets handling
- Database schema migrations
- Public API contract changes (breaking changes)
- Changes to CI/CD workflow files
- Dependency major version upgrades
